    "name": "six-coordinate three-atom witness and certificates",
    "construction": "Let \\(\\mathfrak E_\\star\\) have \\(K=6\\), \\(p_z=1/3\\), \\(O_1=(1,3,5)\\), \\(O_2=(3,4)\\), \\(O_3=(0,1,2,5)\\), \\(v_1=(0,-2,0,-1,0,3)\\), \\(v_2=(0,0,0,1,-1,0)\\), and \\(v_3=(-2,-1,2,0,0,1)\\). For \\(x_i=2\\theta_i-1\\), put \\(P(x)=3x_0x_1-35x_0x_2+3x_0x_5-3x_1x_2+24x_1x_3-45x_1x_5-3x_2x_5-12x_3x_4-36x_3x_5\\), \\(b^\\star(\\theta)=[107+P(x)-3x_0x_1x_2x_5]/72\\), and \\(r^\\star(\\theta)=[110+P(x)]/72\\). Define \\(h_1^\\star=(0,5,1,0,0,1,5,0)\\), \\(h_2^\\star=(0,1,1,0)\\), and \\(h_3^\\star=(0,2,11/3,14/3,2,0,14/3,8/3,8/3,14/3,0,2,14/3,11/3,2,0)\\), in lexicographic order on each \\(O_z\\). Let \\(\\mu^\\star\\) put mass \\(1/16\\) on \\(000000,000111,001011,001110,010011,010100,011100,011111,100000,100111,101011,101100,110000,110101,111000,111011\\), and let \\(\\nu^\\star\\) put mass \\(1/8\\) on \\(000011,001010,010000,011111,100100,101111,110001,111100\\).",
